<title>INDIA: Saudia executive in India to help process claims.</title>
<headline>Saudia executive in India to help process claims.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A senior official of Saudia Arabian Airlines (Saudia) has arrived in India to facilitate the processing of claims relating to November 12 air disaster, the airline said in statement on Friday.</p>
<p>A Saudia Boeing 747 was involved in a mid-air collision on November 12 with a Kazakh Ilyushin IL-76 freighter in which 349 people died.</p>
<p>The arrival in India of Abdulaziz R Al-Hazmi, vice-president International Regions for Saudia will supplement the carrier's efforts to process claims by the next of kin of passengers who died in the air crash, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
